[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3199678026","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109760#issuecomment-3199678026","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109760","id":3199678026,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-tzZK","user":{"login":"AdriaandeJongh","id":5611323,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTEzMjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5611323?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh","html_url":"https://github.com/AdriaandeJongh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-19T08:01:04Z","updated_at":"2025-08-19T08:01:04Z","body":"Very promising PR! I wonder if there's a way to better connect the resources in this dialog so people can better know what is what:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"558\" height=\"276\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-08-19 at 09 56 51\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/51e36e8e-ffef-4eb9-8ccd-b514b6313724\" />\r\n\r\nAs the resource in the 'arr' value slot has the name 'Dialogue' and the array indices values have 'Line', perhaps use those same names in the dialog instead of the generic 'Resource'? This may not be enough though. I can imagine a larger hierarchy of resources where just the type name isn't enough to differentiate between the objects.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3199678026/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3200808075","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109760#issuecomment-3200808075","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109760","id":3200808075,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-yHSL","user":{"login":"SanNull","id":124409014,"node_id":"U_kgDOB2pUtg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124409014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull","html_url":"https://github.com/SanNull","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-19T13:38:26Z","updated_at":"2025-08-19T13:38:26Z","body":"Thanks! I could look into adding the Resource type for the dialog, but as you said, it may not be descriptive enough for larger projects. Maybe in another PR we could make it easier for the user to name their resources without having to open the whole hierarchy and look for the 'name' property, but also we could try and show in a superficial way the resource's properties in the dialog, so they have a better sense of which is which.\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3200808075/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3208706137","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109760#issuecomment-3208706137","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109760","id":3208706137,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_QPhZ","user":{"login":"SanNull","id":124409014,"node_id":"U_kgDOB2pUtg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124409014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull","html_url":"https://github.com/SanNull","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-21T02:03:12Z","updated_at":"2025-08-21T02:07:57Z","body":"Added AdriaandeJongh's suggestion and now Resources on the dialog screen show their class names:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"960\" height=\"557\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ec4feac9-1cd6-4b3f-ba3a-cb019cda7ca0\" />\r\n\r\nAs shown in the image, Dictionaries can perfectly use make unique recursive, so I'll mark this ready for review!\r